function SpellCalc_Data13 takes nothing returns nothing
    set SpellCalcRaw[94]='A171'
    call SaveStr(SpellCalcData,'A171',1,"|cffffcc00Gun Spell|r|nShoots a magic shot at a target unit.|nIf the target is an enemy, damages their HP and MP and dispels any positive effects from them.|nIf the target is an ally, recovers some of their HP and MP and grants them any buffs the hero has for 30 seconds.")
    call SaveStr(SpellCalcData,'A171',101,"|n|n|cffffcc00Damage details|r|nMP damage = floor((200 + floor(INT / 4)) x Gun spell power). HP damage = 4 x MP damage. Allies recover those amounts instead.|nGun spell power = 1 + 50% x mana fraction x (1 + 10% x effective Gun proficiency). Mind Charge doubles it; Concentration multiplies it by 1.5 at full mana.|nSTR/AGI/INT include bonuses. Mana fraction = current MP / maximum MP at cast time. Values are before damage bonuses, defenses and hit rolls; integer divisions round down.")
